{t:'2. Find a bus: local or long distance',d:'Choose <b>Local bus</b> or <b>Long distance</b>, then type where you start and where you go.',h:'You see every bus on that route with the fare. Verified students see half price.',tab:'b',
 s:()=>head+'<div class="seg"><i class="on">Local bus</i><i>Long distance</i></div><div class="fld">From<b>Banasree</b></div><div class="fld">To<b>Kuril</b></div><div class="btn1">Search buses</div><div class="row"><span><b>Taronga</b><br>07:40 · 50 seats left</span><span class="f"><b>৳20</b>Student ৳10</span></div><div class="row"><span><b>Green Dhaka</b><br>08:00 · 43 seats left</span><span class="f"><b>৳20</b>Student ৳10</span></div>'},
{t:'3. Live tracking on the map',d:'Tap <b>Track</b>. The bus moves on the map. Tap <b>Show my location</b> to see how far it is.',h:'The map updates every 5 seconds. You see the stops and how many minutes the bus needs to reach you.',tab:'b',
 s:()=>head+'<h4>Live bus tracking</h4><div class="m">Taronga · Crowding: medium</div><div class="map"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" width="100%" height="100%"><path d="M20 270 C80 240 70 160 140 140 S230 90 280 30" fill="none" stroke="#1D4ED8" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="20" cy="270" r="7" fill="#fff" stroke="#1D4ED8" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="140" cy="140" r="7" fill="#fff" stroke="#1D4ED8" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="280" cy="30" r="7" fill="#fff" stroke="#1D4ED8" stroke-width="3"/><g><animateMotion dur="7s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M20 270 C80 240 70 160 140 140 S230 90 280 30"/><circle r="13" fill="#1D4ED8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="-6" y="-5" width="12" height="9" rx="2" fill="#fff"/></g><circle cx="200" cy="120" r="8" fill="#2563eb" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div><div class="ok1"><b>Bus is 2.1 km from you</b> · about 6 min. Nearest stop: Natun Bazar.</div>'},
{t:'4. Ticket and seat',d:'Pick a seat, pay with card or bKash. The ticket has a code the conductor scans.',h:'You can cancel any time. If the bus cannot run, your money comes back.',tab:'t',
 s:()=>head+'<h4>My ticket</h4><div class="stub"><small>Banasree → Kuril</small><b>Seat 12</b>Taronga · 08:00<div class="a"><i>Cancel</i><i>Share</i></div></div><div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:14px;text-align:center"><svg width="140" height="140" viewBox="0 0 10 10"><rect width="10" height="10" fill="#fff"/><g fill="#0F2557"><rect x="0" y="0" width="3" height="3"/><rect x="7" y="0" width="3" height="3"/><rect x="0" y="7" width="3" height="3"/><rect x="4" y="1" width="1" height="2"/><rect x="5" y="4" width="2" height="1"/><rect x="4" y="6" width="3" height="1"/><rect x="8" y="5" width="1" height="3"/><rect x="5" y="8" width="2" height="2"/><rect x="3" y="4" width="1" height="2"/></g></svg><div class="m">Show this to the conductor</div></div>'},
{t:'5. Emergency: hold the red button',d:'Press and hold the red SOS button for 3 seconds. Try it now with your mouse or finger.',h:'Ride Track staff, traffic police and your bus company get your location. Your family gets an SMS with a map link.',tab:'s',
 s:()=>'<h4 style="text-align:center;color:#0F2557">Emergency help</h4><div class="m" style="text-align:center">৩ সেকেন্ড চেপে ধরে রাখুন</div><div class="sosw"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><circle class="t" cx="60" cy="60" r="54"/><circle class="p" id="rg" cx="60" cy="60" r="54"/></svg><button id="sb">SOS<small>HOLD 3 SEC</small></button></div><div id="sr" class="m" style="text-align:center">Location ready ✓</div><div class="btn1 o">Call 999 · জাতীয় জরুরি সেবা</div>',after:sosInit},
{t:'6. Family, police and calls',d:'Under the SOS button: call 999, find police nearby, call or message family, start a video call.',h:'Voice messages and video go through WhatsApp or a free call link. Nearby police come from the map.',tab:'s',
 s:()=>'<h4 style="color:#0F2557">Emergency help</h4><div class="btn1 r">Call 999</div><div class="row" style="display:block"><b>Police near you</b><br><span class="m">RAB-1 Camp · 2.3 km</span><div class="cb" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"><i>Directions</i><i>Call</i></div></div><div class="row" style="display:block"><b>Rahim (Brother)</b><div class="cb"><i>Call</i><i>SMS</i><i class="w">WhatsApp</i></div></div><div class="row" style="display:block"><b>Video or voice call</b><div class="cb" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"><i>Video call</i><i>Voice call</i></div></div>'},
{t:'7. Travel card and student fare',d:'Recharge the travel card with bKash. Upload your student ID once to get half fare.',h:'The student fare applies only while your ID session year is valid.',tab:'h',
 s:()=>head+'<h4>Travel card</h4><div class="stub"><small>Balance</small><b>৳ 450</b>Card RT48201933<div class="a"><i>Recharge</i><i>History</i></div></div><div class="row"><span><b>Student fare</b><br>Session 2025-26</span><span class="f"><b>50%</b>verified</span></div>'}],
d:[
